      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## Montagio · One-photo effect (Squish)\n\nOne photo becomes a 5 s viral effect: here Squish, a Remade-AI LoRA on Wan 2.1 I2V 480p, in 4 steps with the lightx2v LoRA. Swap the effect LoRA and its trigger words for Cake-ify, Explode, Snap Zoom, Frozen Moment or Full Circle.\n\n**Tip:** The prompt keeps the trigger (`sq41sh squish effect`) and says what the photo shows.\n\n**Models**, under `ComfyUI/models/`:\n- `diffusion_models/wan2.1_i2v_480p_14B_fp8_scaled.safetensors` (Apache-2.0, from Wan-AI/Wan2.1-I2V-14B-480P)\n- `text_encoders/umt5_xxl_fp8_e4m3fn_scaled.safetensors` (Apache-2.0, from google/umt5-xxl)\n- `vae/wan_2.1_vae.safetensors` (Apache-2.0, from Wan-AI/Wan2.1-I2V-14B-480P)\n- `clip_vision/clip_vision_h.safetensors` (MIT, from laion/CLIP-ViT-H-14-laion2B-s32B-b79K)\n- `loras/squish_18.safetensors` (Apache-2.0, from Remade-AI/Squish)\n- `loras/Wan21_I2V_14B_lightx2v_cfg_step_distill_lora_rank64.safetensors` (Apache-2.0, from lightx2v/Wan2.1-I2V-14B-480P-StepDistill-CfgDistill-Lightx2v)\n\nCore nodes only. 156 s warm on an NVIDIA L4 (24 GB), peak 21 to 22.6 GB.\n\nOpen weights only: every file is Apache-2.0 or MIT, pinned by sha256 in Montagio's `registry/models.lock.yaml`."
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
